WEBVTT

1
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,840
You hid pretty quickly

2
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:34,350
You're lucky this time. Don't wait any longer. Aren't you leaving? What are you waiting for?

3
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,310
What if she is pretending not to be a thief?

4
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:39,870
When we go out, don't we just give away Tokikatsuro for nothing?

5
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:40,910
you are too smart

6
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:42,670
I was chased too fast by a bird just now

7
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:44,710
I didn't remember what your name was for a moment.

8
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:46,150
I am Deng Dalang

9
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:49,580
What are these names?

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:47,040
What a wonderful night. It's so comfortable. Little ones, get up and start cooking at dawn. Little ones love to fly. Who loves to fly? Deng Datang comes out.

11
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:49,100
I had a full meal yesterday

12
00:01:49,180 --> 00:01:51,580
What would I call "Beware of Me" if I wanted to sleep more today?

13
00:01:55,560 --> 00:02:02,840
How about you being Tokikuro?

14
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:08,080
Lord Ling has met

15
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:10,440
How do you do that when all four legs have to be clamped?

16
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:12,760
Such a tall and powerful person eats a lot

17
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:18,110
It makes sense to naturally grow quickly. That's what you are.

18
00:02:18,710 --> 00:02:19,710
I made two batches last night

19
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:23,030
This one is left for you to use as breakfast caterpillar

20
00:02:23,470 --> 00:02:27,810
After two nests, it was easy. Now I am in trouble.

21
00:02:28,130 --> 00:02:29,690
The Lord Qing Chong Ling is very ambitious.

22
00:02:29,850 --> 00:02:33,660
He won't let us go.

23
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:36,220
Caterpillars are a buffet to me

24
00:02:36,460 --> 00:02:37,700
No matter how much you come, it’s useless

25
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:45,340
Sure enough it was them

26
00:02:45,740 --> 00:02:47,540
They are the ones who killed our brothers and sisters
